    },
    {
        "content": "<p>13 messages were moved here from <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"579630\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/579630-Project-announcements/topic/Human-powered.20Ado.27s.20formalization/with/625497814\">#Project announcements &gt; Human-powered Ado's formalization</a> by <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110087\">Kim Morrison</span>.</p>",
